  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "心內話 - 無beh koh越頭"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p>&nbsp;</p><h1 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">《無beh koh越頭》</span><span style=\"font-size: large;\">/</span><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">鄭玉鳳</span></h1><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhUyTaBAZsjus1CbC28-iJ9Ug1xIOgd2zq66E6mCckuyMZlnJWEar3YmBaNulgpWeCvHn4ZNwezpdSZMh26XQPJHN-7w0G1p6-fbTSBtroua0U57_shR0H_pg5HNvY2ARlZUT32103z1R8xOFcq_o19QOQ0IdkniYTRPNUwaNgAUCsSoztktpPeDN7AXHo4\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhUyTaBAZsjus1CbC28-iJ9Ug1xIOgd2zq66E6mCckuyMZlnJWEar3YmBaNulgpWeCvHn4ZNwezpdSZMh26XQPJHN-7w0G1p6-fbTSBtroua0U57_shR0H_pg5HNvY2ARlZUT32103z1R8xOFcq_o19QOQ0IdkniYTRPNUwaNgAUCsSoztktpPeDN7AXHo4\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEimnOsqItC-Nf-eLHcU7hJkR0HwcyjFRXuKXPmpb_00kmVQsTs4_8Opp98_VKGXfusHDQZ1UshDfuy7w3-g9tQCB3VwG2APnaY4tqGhxHWnYxoRq83oVtDWsuDsaJPNmeaah-8zBN0MjF1sVBdsmMIJKmCzc3rsYezLxar6Eq1AfG7TL_-a6jgZHtENqh6z\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEimnOsqItC-Nf-eLHcU7hJkR0HwcyjFRXuKXPmpb_00kmVQsTs4_8Opp98_VKGXfusHDQZ1UshDfuy7w3-g9tQCB3VwG2APnaY4tqGhxHWnYxoRq83oVtDWsuDsaJPNmeaah-8zBN0MjF1sVBdsmMIJKmCzc3rsYezLxar6Eq1AfG7TL_-a6jgZHtENqh6z\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgHPzS6Nreq89h8WrvWtyXlUGfw4H9kO2Iws9uWERbhp9iRbYie0c5FXy-L9sDnV2Qx3m6qccfl1VC4Tjl7wMHZ0gAiT-c9KFVMgTu9Moga2usfAwWPZ0jF_L59v6q9EQIyg4vkwSVw4bEKmVhpl6d2mIVX1AkPH_G97lxnDLRswmHJBAtioeOTfIhFJCFF\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img data-original-height=\"729\" data-original-width=\"516\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgHPzS6Nreq89h8WrvWtyXlUGfw4H9kO2Iws9uWERbhp9iRbYie0c5FXy-L9sDnV2Qx3m6qccfl1VC4Tjl7wMHZ0gAiT-c9KFVMgTu9Moga2usfAwWPZ0jF_L59v6q9EQIyg4vkwSVw4bEKmVhpl6d2mIVX1AkPH_G97lxnDLRswmHJBAtioeOTfIhFJCFF=w453-h640\" width=\"453\" /></a></div><br /></div><br /></div><div><span><div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">2024年春天，我總算脫離頭尾蹛20冬ê頭路。Chit个決定我已經躊躇三冬外。理性上，辭頭路，現現就減一筆bē-bái ê月給，ē淡薄仔m̄甘。 情感上，我知影koh做--落-去，我無破病mā ē半痟--ah。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">回想辭頭路進前hit幾冬，逐日入去辦公廳，kha̍p-bē著就想beh辭職。掀開記事簿仔就先tī頂面寫「按算離職日」，日期隨時變來變去，koh等半年、koh等一冬、koh等兩冬、三冬……。無法度hē決心，kám是一世人，siuⁿ少替家己做決定？</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">上尾三冬ê日子，逐日，我人iáu未到辦公室，已經先tī厝--裡加班超過三、四點鐘。自清醒hit一刻，人iáu倒tī眠床頂，規日ê khang-khòe就開始tī我頭殼內tńg-se̍h，親像坐摩天輪án-ne，壓力 、操煩、驚惶，一輾 se̍h過一輾，se̍h到想beh吐chiah甘願收煞。落眠床，kā chhoân好ê劇本，紮去上班ê所在。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">通常規工落--來，早起鋪排ê劇情，真罕得照劇本搬。Chit種煩惱起來囥、蹧躂折磨家己ê死個性，一世人無改！54歲就退休，kám ē hông笑？無身份、無地位，ē要意別人ê眼光。M̄-koh翻頭想，有頭路ê時，mā是無得著啥mih肯定，完全家己想家己tio̍h。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">為著應付別人一直問「退休beh創啥？」，記事簿仔先列一面滿滿ê退休願望（標準答案）：做台語事工、租園作穡、學語言、peh koân山、練ió-gà、出國。排hō͘真cha̍t-chiⁿ，退休就ài活跳跳 ，bōe-sái懶屍、假死，若無，對人歹交代。Hăⁿ，che是啥規定？</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">總算，退休hit日到位--ah。Chiūⁿ北去交電腦，iang同事tī大門口，hip一張相，算是人生chit个坎站ê告別式。包袱仔款款，kap平常就無啥交chhap ê同事sio辭，以後mā mài koh sio揣，mā無想beh koh知公司ê任何代誌，澈底切斷關係，kap過去ê壓力切hō͘離離離。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">行出民生東路100號，外口街路hù-hù叫ê車輛，kap我sio閃身ê過路人，無人thang分享我激動ê心情。20年ê放下，無koh越頭看，攑手ia̍t一台計程車，人生後一站。</span></div></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium; font-weight: 400;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEi10RzPL1r0HYReHsGye0eDuRyBKDCLJ57vMqDHjPrnDx_EWJp4Cn2qS-4oj_eZsSxDSjLcalOOcubtFCahnMprqZSSeYamKS7-SCD3aWHUQuLp7Z3rFgVXRkEcyd0vdxaBFCIpIK-VBPjLRjeNNkMr9e_6-3GRcxGZvEKqFK1s4pJHyVMwMXimScyOrPqQ\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img data-original-height=\"3035\" data-original-width=\"2129\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEi10RzPL1r0HYReHsGye0eDuRyBKDCLJ57vMqDHjPrnDx_EWJp4Cn2qS-4oj_eZsSxDSjLcalOOcubtFCahnMprqZSSeYamKS7-SCD3aWHUQuLp7Z3rFgVXRkEcyd0vdxaBFCIpIK-VBPjLRjeNNkMr9e_6-3GRcxGZvEKqFK1s4pJHyVMwMXimScyOrPqQ=w448-h640\" width=\"448\" /></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">台文通訊BONG報 380期,Lán來講看māi,</span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium; font-weight: 400;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"background-color: white; clear: both; color: #444444; font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"color